<title>NORWAY: TABLE-ELKEM H1 PRE-TAX FALLS 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ELKEM H1 PRE-TAX FALLS 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating income	   4,706     vs	4,738</p>
<p>  Operating profit	     544     vs	  652</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profit		 514     vs	  598</p>
<p>  Net profit		     350     vs	  441</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian metals producer is Elkem ASA. A Reuters poll of eight analysts forecast a first-half operating result of 544 million crowns and pre-tax profits at 506 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
